ate</surname><given-names>V.R.</given-names></name><name><surname>Mbaye</surname><given-names>A.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sambou</surname><given-names>B.</given-names></name><name><surname>Niang</surname><given-names>M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Rollinson</surname><given-names>D.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Royal Society of Tropical Medicine and Hygiene meeting at Manson House, London, 18 May 1995. The epidemiology of human schistosomiasis in the Senegal river basin</article-title><source>Trans. R. Soc. Trop. Med. Hyg</source><volume>90</volume><year>1996</year><fpage>340</fpage><lpage>346</lpage><ext-link ext-link-type="uri" xlink:href="http://dx.doi.org/doi:10.1016/S0035-9203(96)90501-5">doi:10.1016/S0035-9203(96)90501-5</ext-link><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8882173</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib27"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ravaoalimalala</surname><given-names>V.</given-names></name><name><surname>Leutscher</surname><given-names>P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Esterre</surname><given-names>P.</given-names></name><name><surname>Roux</surname><given-names>J.</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Epid&#x000e9;miologie de la schistosomose &#x000e0; <italic>Schistosoma haematobium</italic> dans le fivondronana de Mahabo: situation apr&#x000e8;s la destruction du barrage de Dabara</article-title><source>Arch. Inst. Pasteur Madagascar</source><volume>62</volume><year>1995</year><fpage>133</fpage><lpage>135</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="bib28"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ross</surname><given-names>A.G.</given-names></name><name><surname>Sleigh</surname><given-names>A.C.</given-names></name><name><surname>Li</surname><given-names>Y.</given-names></name><name><surname>Davis</surname><given-names>G.M.</given-names></name><name><surname>Williams</surname><given-names>G.M.</given-names